            <ArticleTitle>A Clinical Perspective on Sudden Cardiac Death.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>177-182</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.15420/aer.2016:11:2</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article presents the epidemiology, aetiology and pathophysiology of sudden cardiac death. The modern management of survivors as well as of family members of victims is discussed, as are the relevant recommendations of guidelines prepared by learned societies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
